# Enable multiple ports for faster scrubbing
SocksPort 9050
SocksPort 9051
SocksPort 9052
SocksPort 9053
SocksPort 9054

# 1. How long Tor waits for the initial SOCKS handshake (Match this to your script!)
SocksTimeout 600

# 2. How long Tor spends trying to build a single circuit (increase if needed)
# Since onions are slow, 60s is safer than 30s
CircuitBuildTimeout 60

# 3. Stop Tor from "learning" timeouts (keeps it consistent)
LearnCircuitBuildTimeout 0

# 4. How long a circuit stays alive before Tor picks a new one (keep high for scraping)
MaxCircuitDirtiness 600

# Keep connections alive during long transfers
KeepalivePeriod 60

# More concurrent circuits for parallel downloads
MaxClientCircuitsPending 16